        <!-- Community guidelines summary -->
        <div class="feature-card" style="margin-top: 1.25rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold-primary);">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Community Guidelines</h3>
            <p>
                Words of Plainness is a space for honest seekers and committed disciples. We ask
                everyone&mdash;on the website and in Discord&mdash;to abide by the same principles:
            </p>
            <ul style="margin: 0.75rem 0 0.75rem 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8;">
                <li><strong>Respectful dialogue.</strong> Disagree with ideas, never with contempt for people.</li>
                <li><strong>Honest questions welcome.</strong> Doubt and seeking are not disqualifying&mdash;they are the starting point of faith.</li>
                <li><strong>No harassment, threats, or personal attacks.</strong> Ever, toward anyone.</li>
                <li><strong>No content that demeans or exploits.</strong> This includes sexual content, hate speech, and content targeting vulnerable people.</li>
                <li><strong>Transparent moderation.</strong> All community content is reviewed. Reported concerns are handled with care, and reporter identity is never disclosed.</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
                <a href="/community-guidelines/" class="text-gold">Read the full Community Guidelines &rarr;</a>
            </p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8;">
                To report a concern&mdash;on the website or in Discord&mdash;use the
                <a href="/safety/" class="text-gold">Safety &amp; Support</a> page or contact
                <a href="#contact" class="text-gold">Brother Aaron</a> directly.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
